hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1064","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne use bakriyaan dein jo wo Aap key sahaaba par taqseem karey. To bakra bacha. To us ne uska Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zikr kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Use tum qurbaan karo. (Bukhari: 2300)"
"1065","[AI-translation] Kaab bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unki bakriyaan Sala mein charti thein. To hamaari aik londi ne hamaari bakriyon mein se aik bakri ko martey huey dekha. To us ne patthar toda aur use us se zibah kar diya. To us ne un se kaha: Na khaao yahan tak ke main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochhun ya Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf bhej kar poochhwaun. Aur us ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uskey baarey mein poochha ya bhej kar poochhwaaya. To Aap ne use khaaney ka hukm diya. (Bukhari: 2304)"
"1066","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jo Aap se taqaza karta tha aur sakhti karta tha. To uskey sahaaba ne uska iraada kya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use chhoro, beshak haq waley ko baat (ka haq) hai. Phir farmaya: Use uski umr jaisa do. Unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Magar uski umr se behtar. To Aap ne farmaya: Use do, beshak tum mein sab se behtar wo hai jo ada karney mein sab se achha hai. (Bukhari: 2306)"
"1067","[AI-translation] Miswar bin Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey jab Aap key paas Hawaazin ka wafd Musalman ho kar aaya aur unhon-ne Aap se maanga ke wo unhey unkey maal aur qaidi wapas kar dein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Mujhey baat mein sab se mehboob sachi hai. To do girohon mein se aik muntakhib karo: Ya qaidi ya maal. Aur beshak main ne tumhara intezaar kya hai. Aur beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taef se wapas aatey huey pandrah raaton tak unka intezaar kya tha. Phir jab un par waazeh hua ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhey do girohon mein se aik key siwa wapas na karengey to unhon-ne kaha: To beshak ham apne qaidi muntakhib kartey hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Musalmaanon mein khadey huey aur Allah ki uskey shayaan-e-shaan sana ki, phir farmaya: Amma baad! Beshak tumharey ye bhai tauba kar key hamaarey paas aey hain. Aur beshak main ne dekha hai ke unhey unkey qaidi wapas kar dun. To tum mein jo pasand karey ke us se khush ho to karey. Aur tum mein jo pasand karey ke wo apne hissey par rahey yahan tak ke ham use usey dein jo Allah hamein sab se pehley maal-e-fai mein dey to karey. To logon ne kaha: Ham ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key liye unkey liye khush ho kar diya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ham nahi jaantey ke tum mein se kis ne us mein ijazat di aur kis ne ijazat na di. To wapas jao yahan tak ke tumharey numaendey hamaari taraf tumhaara muamla uthaein. To log wapas gaey aur unkey numaendon ne un se baat ki. Phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf wapas aey aur Aap ko khabar di ke unhon-ne khush ho kar ijazat dey di hai. (Bukhari: 2307-238)"
"1068","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey Ramazan ki zakaat ki hifaazat par muqarrar kya. To merey paas aaney wala aaya aur khaaney mein se bharney laga. To main ne use pakad liya aur kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main zaroor tumhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf uthaaunga. Us ne kaha: Beshak main mohtaaj hun aur mujh par ghar waley hain aur mujhey sakht haajat hai. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne use chhor diya. To subah hui aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Tumharey qaidi ne pichhli raat kya kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne sakht haajat aur ghar walon ki shikaayat ki. To main ne us par rehem kya aur use chhor diya. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak us ne tum se jhoot kaha hai aur wo wapas aaeyga. To main ne jaan liya ke wo wapas aaeyga, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key qaul (beshak wo wapas aaeyga) ki wajah se. To main ne uska intezaar kya. To wo aaya aur khaaney mein se bharney laga. To main ne use pakad liya aur kaha: Main zaroor tumhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf uthaaunga. Us ne kaha: Mujhey chhoro, beshak main mohtaaj hun aur mujh par ghar waley hain. Main wapas na aaunga. To main ne us par rehem kya aur use chhor diya. To subah hui aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abu Hurairah! Tumharey qaidi ne kya kya? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne sakht haajat aur ghar walon ki shikaayat ki. To main ne us par rehem kya aur use chhor diya. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak us ne tum se jhoot kaha hai aur wo wapas aaeyga. To teesri martaba main ne uska intezaar kya. To wo aaya aur khaaney mein se bharney laga. To main ne use pakad liya aur kaha: Main zaroor tumhey Rasulullah ki taraf uthaaunga. Aur ye aakhri teen martaba hai ke tum kehtey ho ke tum wapas na aaogey, phir wapas aatey ho. Us ne kaha: Mujhey chhoro, main tumhey kalimat sikhaata hun jin se Allah tumhey faeda dega. Main ne kaha: Wo kya hain? Us ne kaha: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to Aayat-ul-Kursi padho (Allah, uskey siwa koi mabood nahi, Zinda Qaem rehne wala) yahan tak ke aayat khatm karo. Beshak tum par Allah ki taraf se hamesha nigehbaan rahega aur subah tak tumharey qareeb shaitaan na aaeyga. To main ne use chhor diya. To subah hui. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tumharey qaidi ne pichhli raat kya kya? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Us ne zikr kya ke wo mujhey kalimat sikhaata hai jin se Allah mujhey faeda dega. To main ne use chhor diya. Aap ne farmaya: Wo kya hain? Main ne kaha: Us ne mujh se kaha: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to Aayat-ul-Kursi uskey awwal se padho yahan tak ke aayat khatm karo (Allah, uskey siwa koi mabood nahi, Zinda Qaem rehne wala). Aur us ne mujh se kaha: Tum par Allah ki taraf se hamesha nigehbaan rahega aur subah tak tumharey qareeb shaitaan na aaeyga. Aur wo bhalai par sab se zyada harees they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak us ne tum se sach kaha hai jabke wo jhootha hai. Tum jaantey ho ke tum teen raaton se kisse baat kar rahey ho ae Abu Hurairah? Unhon-ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Wo shaitaan hai. (Bukhari: 2311)"
"1069","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Bilaal Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas umda khajoor ley kar aey. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ye kahaan se hai? Bilaal ne kaha: Hamaarey paas kharaab khajoor thi. To main ne us mein se do saa ko saa key badley becha taake Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khilaaun. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt farmaya: Haey haey! Aankh ka sood, aankh ka sood! Aisa na karo. Lekin jab tum khareedna chaaho to khajoor ko doosri be key badley becho, phir use khareedo. (Bukhari: 2312)"
"1070","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nuaimaan ya Ibn Nuaimaan sharaabi laaya gaya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke jo ghar mein they use maarein. Unhon-ne kaha: To main un mein tha jinhon-ne use maara. To ham ne use jooton aur tehniyon se maara. (Bukhari: 2316). Mazaaraat ki kitaab."
